    {
      "cve": "CVE-2026-86247",
      "ids": [
        {
          "system_name": "SUSE CVE Page",
          "text": "https://www.suse.com/security/cve/CVE-2026-86247"
        }
      ],
      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Race condition within a thread vulnerability in Apache Tomcat Native allowed client certificate verification requirements to be down-graded for some configurations.\n\n\n\nThis issue affects Apache Tomcat Native: from 2.0.0 through 2.0.15, from 1.3.0 through 1.3.8. Unsupported versions may also be affected.\n\n\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 2.0.16 or 1.3.9, which fixes the issue.",
